{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1550615-signature-purviews-dominion-boons","id":1550615,"title":"Signature Purviews Dominion Boons","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Onyx Path Worlds","Scion"],"posts":[{"date":"2025-05-02T19:54:58-07:00","id":1550615,"title":"Signature Purviews Dominion Boons","content":"In the Scion: Demigod Companion, we're presented with the Dominion Boons for the 5 Signature Purviews of the Pantheons presented in Scion: Demigod, but I can't find a single place where the Dominion Boons are presented for any of the other Signature Purviews for the Pantheons from Hero. Am I missing something?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1006-widdershawns","name":"widdershawns","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1006_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"87"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2025-05-03T07:55:05-07:00","id":1550626,"title":"","content":"I think i'm blind, I only see the Signature Purviews for the new Pantheons, but not their Dominion Boons.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/422-lykas","name":"Lykas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar422_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"198"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2025-05-03T15:10:49-07:00","id":1550643,"title":"","content":"So, I thought that the original Demigod campaign would have mentioned it only being the Demigod Pantheons, but having taken a look at the Kickstarter page again, that's surprisingly not the case:<br /> <br /> &quot;ACHIEVED! - At $65,000 in funding \u2013 Scion: Demigod Companion \u2013 New Boons \u2013 New Boons for Purviews, including Pantheon-Specific Purviews for every <i><b>extant</b></i> pantheon, will be created and released in a supplemental PDF, which will be added to the rewards list of all backers receiving the Scion: Demigod PDF.&quot;<br /> <br /> Emphasis mine. Extant of course means every Pantheon available, being fair that can be reduced to &quot;Every Pantheon available <i>at the point of Demigod.&quot;</i> Which it obviously wasn't here. It's admittedly a bit disappointing that it turned out to be less interesting than what was stated on the Kickstarter campaign.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26317-critian-caceorte","name":"Critian Caceorte","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"246"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2025-05-03T15:34:00-07:00","id":1550649,"title":"","content":"There has got to be intention for Dominion Boons for the rest of the Signature Purviews, because just having them for 5 Pantheons is pretty silly. <br /> <br /> I had assumed that the Signature Purviews just didn't have them before the release of the Companion, which I guess I thought made sense. Now, however, it's just a word oversight","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1006-widdershawns","name":"widdershawns","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1006_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"87"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}